### Step 9: Handle Edge Case -- InvitePeople from CreateRoom Flow

When `invitePeople` is navigated to with `isCreateRoom: true`, there may be no `RoomMembersProvider` mounted yet (since the user hasn't entered the room). In this case, `useRoomMembers()` will return an empty array, which is correct -- a newly created room has no other members to filter against. This edge case is handled naturally.

